          "briefTitle": "A Study of PRMT5 Inhibitor BAY 3713372 in Participants With MTAP-deleted Solid Tumors",
          "officialTitle": "A First-in-human Study to Evaluate the Safety, Tolerability and Pharmacokinetics, Pharmacodynamics and Preliminary Clinical Activity of BAY 3713372, a Novel 2nd Generation PRMT5 Inhibitor, in Participants With MTAP-deleted Solid Tumors."
        },
