          "briefTitle": "Dose-Escalation Radiotherapy in Limited-Stage Small Cell Lung Cancer: A Phase III Randomized Trial",
          "officialTitle": "Phase III Randomized Clinical Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Twice-Daily Hyperfractionated Dose-Escalated Thoracic Radiotherapy in Patients With Limited-Stage Small Cell Lung Cancer (ESCALADOR Study)",
          "acronym": "ESCALADOR"
