              "description": "Patients will be undergo \\[68Ga\\]Ga DOTA-5G PET/CT scans to confirm eligibility for the \\[177Lu\\]Lu DOTA-ABM-5G therapy. Patients with sufficient lesion uptake of \\[68Ga\\]Ga DOTA-5G PET/CT will be offered therapy. Patients will undergo a follow up \\[68Ga\\]Ga DOTA-5G PET/CT scans to assess tretament efficacy.",
