              "name": "albendazole plus praziquantel regime",
              "description": "Subjects will receive a combination of albendazole plus praziquantel, as a standard treatment for brain cysticercosis (neurocysticercosis), orally, for ten days. Albendazole will be given at 15/kg/d and praziquantel at 50/kg/d.",
              "armGroupLabels": [
