          "briefTitle": "Efficacy and Safety of Rapamycin Versus Vigabatrin in the Prevention of Tuberous Sclerosis Complex Symptoms in Infants",
          "officialTitle": "Randomized, Placebo-controlled, Double-blind and Double-dummy Clinical Trial Comparing the Safety, Tolerability, and Efficacy of Vigabatrin and Rapamycin in a Preventive Treatment of Infants With Tuberous Sclerosis Complex",
          "acronym": "ViRap"
        },
        "statusModule": {
