          "briefTitle": "Oocyte Activation: Revised or Initial AGT Technique, Which is Better?! A Sibling-oocytes-split Design",
          "officialTitle": "Oocyte Activation: Revised or Initial Activated Gamete Treatment (AGT) Technique, Which is Better?! A Sibling-oocytes-split Design and Case Series of Chemical Pregnancies"
        },
