              "title": "28-Day partial seizure frequency",
              "description": "The partial seizure frequency for the baseline period was the total number of partial seizures recorded for that period at Visit 0 (week 0). This was evaluated for 264 participants.",
              "paramType": "MEAN",
              "dispersionType": "STANDARD_DEVIATION",
              "unitOfMeasure": "seizures",
              "classes": [
