| Item | Details |
|------|---------|
| **Title of Met object** | *Ia Orana Maria* (often rendered as “Hail Mary”) |
| **Artist** | Paul Gauguin |
| **Credit line (as listed by the Met)** | *Bequest of Sam A. Lewisohn, 1951* |
| **Object ID** | 438821 |
