          "briefTitle": "The Risk of Intraventricular Hemorrhage With Flat Midline Versus Right-Tilted Flat Lateral Head Positions",
          "officialTitle": "The Risk of Intraventricular Hemorrhage With Flat Midline Versus Right-Tilted Flat Lateral Head Positions in Preterm Infant Less Than 30 Weeks of Gestation: a Multicenter Randomized Control Trial"
        },
        "statusModule": {
          "statusVerifiedDate": "2013-11",
